{"chapter": "etale-cohomology", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "03NF", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{U} = \\{\\varphi_i : U_i \\to U\\}_{i\\in I}$", "MATH_0003": "$U \\in \\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0004": "$I$", "MATH_0005": "$i\\in I$", "MATH_0006": "$\\varphi_i : U_i \\to U$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0008": "$U$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "STRUCT_0005": "\\end{enumerate}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-family-morphisms-fixed-target}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:c6eba3364eec92cd305367a2a6c917a8be68103f19fdc988f34357bbf79a70bc", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:7cd3c3c7dfa46e353d365b15981eb26daf72c3dddae4bcbc72a6e5a920516c6c", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a category. A <TEXTITOPEN_0001>family of morphisms with fixed target<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>\n<MATH_0002> is the data of\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> an object <MATH_0003>,\n<STRUCT_0003> a set <MATH_0004> (possibly empty), and\n<STRUCT_0004> for all <MATH_0005>, a morphism <MATH_0006> of <MATH_0007>\nwith target <MATH_0008>.\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:853b5e0d2cfb47e630d3df7b15fc1ac8c6a23725ec12176749d23927f10f9065", "unit_id": "tag:03NG:statement"}
{"chapter": "etale-cohomology", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "03NF", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{sites-section-refinements}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0002": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it ", "TEXTITOPEN_0002": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:2d9939834754b47f43c0fe4deb1fb18e3efe0f1c5d2ed34dab2b762a8973e344", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nThere is a notion of a <TEXTITOPEN_0001>morphism of families of morphisms with fixed\ntarget<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>. A special case of that is the notion of a <TEXTITOPEN_0002>refinement<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>.\nA reference for this material is\nSites, Section <REF_0001>.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:037b1acc37347c15f00f0f43d7c8e8793eab6871c2936beecae38130898070ee", "unit_id": "tag:03NF:prose-0001"}
{"chapter": "etale-cohomology", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "03NF", "placeholders": {"FOOTNOTECLOSE_0001": "}", "FOOTNOTEOPEN_0001": "\\footnote{", "MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\text{Cov}(\\mathcal{C})$", "MATH_0003": "$\\varphi : V \\to U$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\{\\varphi : V \\to U\\}$", "MATH_0006": "$\\{\\varphi_i : U_i \\to U\\}_{i\\in I}$", "MATH_0007": "$i \\in I$", "MATH_0008": "$\\{\\psi_{ij} : U_{ij} \\to U_i \\}_{j\\in I_i}$", "MATH_0009": "$$\n\\{\n\\varphi_i \\circ \\psi_{ij} : U_{ij} \\to U\n\\}_{(i, j)\\in \\prod_{i\\in I} \\{i\\} \\times I_i}\n$$", "MATH_0010": "$\\{U_i \\to U\\}_{i\\in I}$", "MATH_0011": "$V \\to U$", "MATH_0012": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0013": "$i \\in I$", "MATH_0014": "$U_i \\times_U V$", "MATH_0015": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0016": "$\\{U_i \\times_U V \\to V\\}_{i\\in I}$", "REF_0001": "\\cite[Expos\\'e II, D\\'efinition 1.3]{SGA4}", "REF_0002": "\\cite{ArtinTopologies}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "STRUCT_0005": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0006": "\\item", "STRUCT_0007": "\\item", "STRUCT_0008": "\\end{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0009": "\\end{enumerate}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0002": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it ", "TEXTITOPEN_0002": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-site}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:6e275e07a662332fac36108b0e049dd02c161353851dae0b81462d24a1bea3a8", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:8fe64b8c6386d19ddefba4ae591a5069497441fcccfd580e30813a0a83c7d965", "source_text": "A <TEXTITOPEN_0001>site<TEXTITCLOSE_0001><FOOTNOTEOPEN_0001>What we call a site is a called a category endowed with\na pretopology in <REF_0001>.\nIn <REF_0002> it is called a category with a Grothendieck\ntopology.<FOOTNOTECLOSE_0001> consists of a category <MATH_0001> and a set\n<MATH_0002> consisting of families of morphisms with fixed target\ncalled <TEXTITOPEN_0002>coverings<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>, such that\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> (isomorphism) if <MATH_0003> is an isomorphism in <MATH_0004>,\nthen <MATH_0005> is a covering,\n<STRUCT_0003> (locality) if <MATH_0006> is a covering and\nfor all <MATH_0007> we are given a covering\n<MATH_0008>, then\n<MATH_0009>\nis also a covering, and\n<STRUCT_0004> (base change) if <MATH_0010>\nis a covering and <MATH_0011> is a morphism in <MATH_0012>, then\n<STRUCT_0005>\n<STRUCT_0006> for all <MATH_0013> the fibre product\n<MATH_0014> exists in <MATH_0015>, and\n<STRUCT_0007> <MATH_0016> is a covering.\n<STRUCT_0008>\n<STRUCT_0009>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:f70fd258029d0fbb94032920a170fadff30bac38cc1d7bea5e5f21e204d5fc8e", "unit_id": "tag:03NH:statement"}
